WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,960
How could the guy who just walked in know that Ah Yue was allergic to peaches?

2
00:00:04,960 --> 00:00:08,200
It’s not easy to climb the monkey tree

3
00:00:08,200 --> 00:00:22,270
Invite the two gods to me, Mrs. Prince.

4
00:00:22,270 --> 00:00:24,190
What kind of peace of mind do you have?

5
00:00:24,190 --> 00:00:25,910
A Miao is not married yet

6
00:00:25,910 --> 00:00:27,310
If the face is disfigured

7
00:00:27,310 --> 00:00:28,870
Can you afford it?

8
00:00:28,870 --> 00:00:30,870
It turns out he came for me.

9
00:00:30,870 --> 00:00:32,630
Good timing

10
00:00:32,630 --> 00:00:34,430
The old lady has not returned home yet.

11
00:00:34,430 --> 00:00:35,750
Shen Ye is not here again

12
00:00:35,750 --> 00:00:37,510
This is to take advantage of the fact that I have no one to protect me.

13
00:00:37,510 --> 00:00:40,390
Put the charge of evil thoughts firmly on my head

14
00:00:40,390 --> 00:00:42,570
The words of the two gods

15
00:00:42,570 --> 00:00:44,380
Why can't I understand

16
00:00:44,460 --> 00:00:46,100
This cloth bird on the table

17
00:00:46,100 --> 00:00:48,740
Is it the meeting gift you gave to Ah Yue a few days ago?
